{{Velious Era}}The Wakening Land is a large forested valley on this otherwise frozen continent. The goddess Tunare has a very palpable presence here, and is the reason that the area is so full of life. The storm giants of Kael Drakkal attempt to push back at the forest, but the Tunarian Residents and Claws of Veeshan have forged a passive alliance to fight their common enemy.

