== Dangers ==

*The zone is split up into several general areas, each with their own dangers. The first area everyone sees is outside the back door of Kael Drakkal. This area is frequented by the frost and storm giants, and is dangerous to most unless they've made friends with them.

*Moving south to the next area, which is another area of interest to many people, is where the Dragon Portal is located. The area seems very quiet, but in fact it is too quiet. The great dragon Wuoshi makes her home right at the portal. She is on the same faction as Skyshrine, so unless you've made friends there, she will attack you and, unless you're in a very large group or very lucky, most likely kill you.

*Farther west lies the geonid tunnels. The geonids are generally friendly, but the tar goos which can be found occasionally there are not, and if they attack you, so will the geonids. The next area to the west is occupied by the "flying monkeys" or the Holgresh. These are aggressive and are known to wander throughout the zone, instead of staying in their own area. Further west lies the entrance to Skyshrine. There is nothing inherently dangerous about this, except that the Raptors and Faerie Dragon live here, and are inherently aggressive to everyone who travels through.

*Moving back east, most of the top half of the zone is filled with creatures devoted to Tunare. This means that if Tunare doesn't like you (you know who you are) this is probably not the place for you to be. If Tunare doesn't mind you, however, this place is safe. There are also Sentient Suit Armors in this section, but they live in ruined houses and are easy to avoid.

== Benefits ==

*The Wakening Land provides several discrete areas in which to hunt, each with its own faction involved as well.

*There are several quests for high level characters each having stories which are quite interesting.

*Lots of gem drops from various mobs.

== Traveling To and From ==

*Druid/Wizard Port Circle at -3000, -3000.

*Druid/Wizard evacuate spells both carry travelers to the loc -673, -4989.

*[[Kael Drakkal]] is located at -650, -5050.

*[[Skyshrine]] is located at 1450, 4500.

*The [[Plane of Growth]] is on the island (465, -1069) at the middle of the zone atop the tower, where you touch a small tree and are teleported to the Plane of Growth. Be careful, though, the tree has a large clickable area, and you don't want to end up in the Plane of Growth if Tunare doesn't like you.

